      "localizedDescription": "VCMI is an open-source engine that re-implements Heroes of Might and Magic III so the classic turn-based strategy game runs on modern hardware — with widescreen and high-resolution support, extensive modding (including the popular HotA and Era mods), stabilized multiplayer and quality-of-life improvements over the original. Requires a copy of the original game's data files.",
